---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Base title="Responsible Gambling" description="the site is committed to responsible gambling. Warning signs, self-exclusion, deposit limits, and where to get free confidential help.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Responsible Gambling</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      Betting should always be fun, never a way to make money or escape problems. {SITE.name} is committed
      to promoting safer gambling. If betting stops being entertainment, it is time to stop.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 p-5 rounded-xl border-2 border-brand-500/30 bg-brand-500/5">
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-brand-400 mb-2">Need help now?</h2>
      <p class="text-sm">
        Free, confidential, 24/7 helplines below. You do not need to give your name.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm">
        <li><strong class="text-white">Cyprus KEΘΕΑ:</strong> 210 9237777</li>
        <li><strong class="text-white">UK GamCare:</strong> 0808 8020 133</li>
        <li><strong class="text-white">EU/Global:</strong> <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="https://www.begambleaware.org" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">BeGambleAware.org</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Golden rules</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li>Only bet what you can comfortably afford to lose.</li>
      <li>Set a deposit and time limit — and stick to it.</li>
      <li>Never chase losses.</li>
      <li>Don't bet under the influence or to escape stress.</li>
      <li>Keep betting a small part of your life.</li>
      <li>Don't borrow to bet.</li>
      <li>Take regular breaks. If it stops being fun, walk away.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Warning signs</h2>
    <p>If any of these describe you or someone you know, seek help:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-2">
      <li>Betting more than you planned or can afford.</li>
      <li>Hiding gambling from family or friends.</li>
      <li>Borrowing money to bet.</li>
      <li>Feeling anxious, guilty or depressed about betting.</li>
      <li>Chasing losses with bigger bets.</li>
      <li>Neglecting work, family, or health because of betting.</li>
      <li>Thinking about gambling constantly.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Tools that work</h2>
    <p>Every licensed bookmaker on this site offers these — use them:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-2">
      <li><strong class="text-white">Deposit limits</strong> — cap daily / weekly / monthly deposits.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Loss limits</strong> — hard stop when losses hit your set amount.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Time limits</strong> — auto-logout after X minutes.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Reality checks</strong> — periodic pop-ups showing time & money spent.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Cool-off periods</strong> — pause account 24h to 6 weeks.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Self-exclusion</strong> — block yourself for 6 months to 5 years.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Self-exclusion (whole-market)</h2>
    <p>Block yourself across ALL licensed operators in one signup:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-2">
      <li><strong class="text-white">UK</strong>: <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="https://www.gamstop.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">GAMSTOP</a></li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Malta / EU</strong>: contact each operator</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Cyprus</strong>: contact <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="https://www.nba.gov.cy" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">National Betting Authority</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Support organisations</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-3 mt-3">
      <li class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50">
        <strong class="block text-white">BeGambleAware</strong>
        <a class="text-brand-400 text-sm underline" href="https://www.begambleaware.org" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">begambleaware.org</a>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Free, confidential help online and by phone.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50">
        <strong class="block text-white">GamCare</strong>
        <a class="text-brand-400 text-sm underline" href="https://www.gamcare.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">gamcare.org.uk</a>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Helpline 0808 8020 133 · Live chat · Support groups.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50">
        <strong class="block text-white">Gambling Therapy</strong>
        <a class="text-brand-400 text-sm underline" href="https://www.gamblingtherapy.org" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">gamblingtherapy.org</a>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Global multilingual support and forums.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50">
        <strong class="block text-white">KEΘΕΑ (Cyprus)</strong>
        <a class="text-brand-400 text-sm underline" href="https://www.kethea.gr" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">kethea.gr</a>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Cyprus & Greece helpline: 210 9237777 · Free & confidential.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50">
        <strong class="block text-white">Gamblers Anonymous</strong>
        <a class="text-brand-400 text-sm underline" href="https://www.gamblersanonymous.org" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">gamblersanonymous.org</a>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">In-person and online meetings worldwide.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
      You must be {SITE.minAge} or over to gamble. {SITE.name} publishes information about sports betting for
      entertainment purposes. We do not accept wagers. Every operator we recommend is licensed by a European
      regulator. If gambling is affecting your life, please seek help — it works.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
